 clickable links in chat

- Settings gets WhatsApp/Instagram/Facebook/TikTok/Website fields
  (businesses.social_links jsonb, migration 0013)
- buildContext.ts feeds these to Mira as a Contact & social links
  section; buildPrompt.ts tells her to share them as plain https://
  URLs when asked, never invent one that isn't configured
- lib/linkify.tsx renders any https:// URL in a message as a real
